[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    52[0m:[38;5;10m[49m redirected around each call) **plus** the post-call `house_t` bytes.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    53[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Every row uses many randomized inputs from a fixed-seed SplitMix64 generator.
